		{"id":"c013","type":"file","file":"class_AI/what-the-ai-is.md","x":-1960,"y":920,"width":700,"height":305},
		{"id":"c001","type":"text","text":"# AI · ML · DL — What You Actually Need to Know\n> A developer / majorer's map. Each branch lists the non‑negotiables, and links the [[.md]] notes that back them. Follow the arrows: AI ⊃ ML ⊃ DL.","x":-2920,"y":-1680,"width":760,"height":200,"color":"0"},
		{"id":"c018","type":"file","file":"class_AI/AI_Ethics_Responsible_AI.md","x":-1280,"y":-930,"width":740,"height":270},
		{"id":"c016","type":"file","file":"class_AI/ai_history_current_trends.md","x":-1280,"y":-1290,"width":740,"height":270},
		{"id":"c010","type":"file","file":"class_AI/AI_Foundations_Weeks_1-2.md","x":-1280,"y":-560,"width":740,"height":320},
		{"id":"c003","type":"text","text":"**📊 ML**\nlearn from *data* instead of hard‑coding rules.\nA subset of AI.","x":430,"y":-1640,"width":380,"height":90,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"c004","type":"text","text":"**🧠 DL**\nML with *deep neural networks*.\nThe subset of ML that powered 2012→now.","x":2520,"y":-1550,"width":380,"height":90,"color":"2"},
		{"id":"c030","type":"text","text":"**What you must know (DL)**\n• Neural net, activation fn, loss, **backprop / grad descent**\n• Architectures: **CNN** · **RNN** · **Transformer** (attention)\n• Training: overfit, regularize, optimize\n• Generative: GAN, diffusion, **LLMs**\n• **RAG · fine‑tuning · agents · tool calling**\n• Deploy: quantize, serve, monitor","x":2520,"y":-1240,"width":380,"height":340,"color":"2"},
		{"id":"c020","type":"text","text":"**What you must know (ML)**\n• 3 families: **supervised · unsupervised · RL**\n• Core algos: linear/logistic, trees/forests, k‑means, SVM\n• **Metrics**: accuracy, precision/recall, F1, ROC‑AUC\n• Train/val/test split + the data caveats\n• The math underneath: **stats + linear algebra**\n• Feature engineering > model cleverness","x":430,"y":-1430,"width":380,"height":320,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"c024","type":"file","file":"class_AI/Mathematics_for_AI_Weeks_2-4.md","x":1150,"y":-1040,"width":570,"height":280},
