		{"id":"c046","type":"file","file":"05-AI-Research/Deep Dives/Python.md","x":-520,"y":1289,"width":420,"height":303},
		{"id":"c041","type":"text","text":"**🛠 The Developer / Major layer (what actually gets you hired)**\nPython + the ML stack · **MLOps** (data→model→API, monitor, retrain) · System design & cost/latency trade‑offs · Evaluation before claims · Reproducibility (seed + versioned data + locked deps) · Portfolio & résumé.","x":-240,"y":-40,"width":1750,"height":160,"color":"5"},
