		{"id":"c002","type":"text","text":"**🤖 AI**\nthe broad field — systems that do *intelligence* tasks.\nYou need to know what it **is / isn't**.","x":-1970,"y":-1580,"width":530,"height":140,"color":"1"},
		{"id":"c008","type":"text","text":"**What you must know (AI)**\n• What AI is *vs* what it's not\n• Narrow AI · General AI · Generative AI\n• Where AI/ML/DL nest (the umbrella)\n• History & 2026 trends\n• Real domains: health, finance, autonomous\n• Ethics, bias, accountability","x":-1970,"y":-1290,"width":530,"height":240,"color":"1"},
